1
00:00:02,091 --> 00:00:07,183
Southern Plants.

2
00:00:07,183 --> 00:00:24,929
One day, Tue Tinh led students up Nam Tao, Bac Dau mountains, he said:

3
00:00:24,929 --> 00:00:32,229
Those tree trunks, grass roots under your feet are very precious.

4
00:00:32,229 --> 00:00:36,194
He told students:

5
00:00:36,194 --> 00:00:51,205
When Thai invaders invaded our country, they banned Chinese people from carrying medicine, utensils to sell to Southern people.

6
00:00:51,205 --> 00:01:03,815
King Tran was worried when about to go to battle, there would be injured people, what to use to cure them?

7
00:01:03,815 --> 00:01:16,594
King ordered royal physicians to go to all regions to learn how to treat diseases with wild plants.

8
00:01:16,594 --> 00:01:24,345
Medicine gardens were established everywhere.

9
00:01:24,345 --> 00:01:37,094
Nam Tao and Bac Dau mountains are exactly two mountains where wild plants of Tran kings were planted.

10
00:01:37,094 --> 00:01:53,621
Southern wild plants have treated wounds, protected health for our army...

11
00:01:53,621 --> 00:02:03,679
Now we want to follow ancestors' path so our people can use Southern medicine to treat Southern people.

12
00:02:03,679 --> 00:02:11,997
All students voluntarily followed teacher's path.

13
00:02:11,997 --> 00:02:24,832
Until now there have been hundreds of medicines taken from Southern wild plants to treat diseases very effectively.

